adjudication.rationale:
In smsReminderManager.ts, deleteScheduledSMSReminder now does both the Twilio cancellation and the Prisma row delete inside a single try block:

```ts
if (referenceId) await twilio.cancelSMS(referenceId);
await prisma.workflowReminder.delete({ where: { id: reminderId } });
```

If `twilio.cancelSMS(referenceId)` throws, execution jumps to `catch` and the Prisma `delete` is skipped. The diff also removes the previous unconditional Prisma cleanup in callers (e.g., handleCancelBooking.ts, bookings router, workflows router removed `workflowReminder.deleteMany(...)` / `Promise.all(remindersToDelete)`), so a thrown Twilio cancel can now leave `WorkflowReminder` rows undeleted where they previously would have been deleted regardless. This matches the finding.
